+ row  `↯/s.82.1.1`  `Unavailable`  `[↯/s.82.1.1] the audio line could not be opened`

- row  `↯/s.82.1.2`  `UnsupportedConfiguration`  `[↯/s.82.1.2] the requested configuration is not supported`
